  "reviewNotes": [
    "These are syndrome/disease decision thresholds, not pediatric normal vital-sign or laboratory reference intervals.",
    "The source has a 17.5 vs 17.7 ×10^9/L leukocytosis discrepancy for age 1 month-1 year between Table 7 and Table 8; both are preserved.",
    "Neutrophil, CRP and procalcitonin cutoffs are printed as ranges; MiniMed must not choose one endpoint as a universal executable threshold without review.",
    "Absence of a bradycardia value for older age bands is stored as null rather than inferred.",
    "No autonomous SIRS, sepsis or bacterial-infection diagnosis is generated from this table."
  ]
